- **audio_rating:** An 8-speaker stereo was standard, with premium options available (likely Harman/Kardon). Score: 0.50 (Standard is average, premium is good).
- **usb_ports:** USB input was available. Likely one or two ports. Score: -0.30.

**Comfort & Convenience:**
- **comfort_feature_score:** Features like automatic dual-zone climate control, power front seats (with memory available), heated front seats (heated rear seats optional), ventilated and massaging front seats were available. Optional AIRMATIC suspension enhanced comfort. This offers a good range of comfort features, some of which are still considered premium today. Score: 0.80.
- **convenience_feature_score:** Features like cruise control, front and rear parking sensors, active park assist, power tailgate, rain-sensing wipers, and a rearview camera (and 360 camera) were available. Heated and cooled cup holders were also an option. This offers a high level of convenience features, including some advanced ones for its time. Score: 0.70.

